exports[`renderTerminal > shop grouped list 1`] = `
"database
~ orders ─customer_id─▶ customers
         ─status──────▶ enum order_status
    +coupon_code text · ~status order_status
+ invoices ─order_id─▶ orders
           ─method───▶ enum payment_method
    id uuid · +order_id uuid · +number text
~ enum order_status
    +refunded
~ enum payment_method
    +bank_transfer

backend
~ model OrderStatus ─mirrors─▶ enum order_status
+ model Invoice ─maps─▶ invoices
+ endpoint POST /orders/{id}/refund ─sets refunded─▶ model OrderStatus
~ model PaymentMethod ─mirrors─▶ enum payment_method

config
+ migration: backfill invoices for… ─reads─────▶ INVOICE_PREFIX
                                    ─backfills─▶ invoices
◆ INVOICE_PREFIX
◆ feature flag refundsEnabled ─gates─▶ endpoint POST /orders/{id}/refund

12 nodes · 4 new · 5 changed · 2 config
key: + new  ~ changed  - removed  ◆ config · unmarked = unchanged
gaps: customers: columns besides id not read
not on map: tests: test_invoice_backfill.py · docs: CHANGELOG.md, .env.example
"
`;

